    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl30-tab",
    "name": "PX4 PARAM_REQUEST_LIST collect",
    "info": "Collects the full PX4 parameter table into one array on output 0 (status list-complete).\nAssert function checks length > 0 and known ids COM_RC_IN_MODE / MPC_XY_VEL_MAX.\n\nConnection: PX4 bind 0.0.0.0:14560 → 127.0.0.1:14561 sysid 11.",
